stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> submitted : Seller creates listing
  submitted --> in_review : Specialist claims review
  in_review --> published : Approved (100% pages viewed, checklist passed)
  in_review --> changes_requested : Changes requested (comment)
  in_review --> rejected : Rejected (comment, strike)
  published --> suspended : Report threshold reached / Specialist suspends
  suspended --> published : Follow-up review approved
  suspended --> archived : Taken down (strike)
  published --> archived : Random audit taken down
  changes_requested --> [*]
  rejected --> [*]
  archived --> [*]
